 '{"rails":"roof rails standard on Sport, TrailSport, Touring and Elite (Honda Info Center, 2023 and 2024); LX and EX-L have a bare roof and need a door-frame clamp kit; up to 165 lb on the rails with accessory crossbars (Honda)","third_row":true,"tow":"5,000 lb AWD; 3,500 lb 2WD (Honda)","variants":["TrailSport","Black Edition 2025+","Touring Blackout 2026"],"hitch":"integrated Class III trailer hitch standard on the TrailSport only (Honda Info Center); other trims have no factory receiver unless a dealer fitted one","roof_type_fact":"roof rails on Sport, TrailSport, Touring and Elite; bare roof on LX and EX-L (Honda, 2023 and 2024)","roof_phrase":"your roof (rails on Sport, TrailSport, Touring and Elite; bare on LX and EX-L per Honda)","roof_fact":"165 lb on the roof rails with accessory crossbars (Honda)","hitch_fact":"Class III factory hitch on the TrailSport only (Honda); other trims need one added","hitch_check":"Only the TrailSport has a factory hitch (Honda). On other trims look under the rear bumper for a dealer-fitted receiver before buying one."}',
